# Roost local config — copy to ".env" (which is gitignored) to activate.
# Roost ships with NO webhook secret. By default, Contact-form submissions are relayed to
# the project's hosted HiStak endpoint, which forwards them to the project's Slack.
#
# To send feedback to YOUR OWN Slack/Discord instead (and not the project), set either:
#   CONTACT_WEBHOOK_BUG=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...     # bug reports
#   CONTACT_WEBHOOK_FEATURE=https://hooks.slack.com/services/... # feature requests
# or a single fallback for both:
#   CONTACT_WEBHOOK=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...
#
# To relay to a different endpoint instead of the project default:
#   FEEDBACK_RELAY=https://your-host.example.com/api/contact
